    {
      "id": "1F3Ou9R6sHauX7hMOlc-L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4639.060909665779,
      "y": 385.71169726557184,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1667047045,
      "version": 1097,
      "versionNonce": 1784117317,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- the idea is that, in that 100ms of time slot\nwill be shared across all of the containers that\nneeds some % of time on that core",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- the idea is that, in that 100ms of time slot will be shared across all of the containers that needs some % of time on that core",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VMkW1R-ZNojrNqCUZ_Wsy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4645.094073232791,
      "y": 569.9534606811527,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 975729291,
      "version": 1310,
      "versionNonce": 262809509,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- so, if we say that a particular container needs\n25% of CPU/Core, we mean that, out of 100ms\nour container would need 25ms of core ",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- so, if we say that a particular container needs 25% of CPU/Core, we mean that, out of 100ms our container would need 25ms of core ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WsWlqTipymdfnTdmhw3b1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4651.364148738585,
      "y": 744.5245663396228,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 853444203,
      "version": 1431,
      "versionNonce": 162523909,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- we can represent cpu limit using % or a unit 'm'\nstands for millicore",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- we can represent cpu limit using % or a unit 'm' stands for millicore",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MF3u7BIRSHlIBa42hNnNJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3458.264434600369,
      "y": 50.92195448591292,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0pG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1345207403,
      "version": 1814,
      "versionNonce": 2028356197,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 1000m represents full 100% of the time i.e. if\na container asks for 1000m cpu limit it needs a\nfull 100ms of core",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 1000m represents full 100% of the time i.e. if a container asks for 1000m cpu limit it needs a full 100ms of core",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "geicLTlkYiSLbNx_7FzCE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3458.58292074161,
      "y": 219.74982306673746,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 64279243,
      "version": 1881,
      "versionNonce": 303738309,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 500m => 50%\n- 250m => 25%",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 500m => 50%\n- 250m => 25%",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QdEUvRvfALh_g_uTCpjjd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4650.772929805957,
      "y": 870.6389549057326,
      "width": 1020.6510780159086,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1669473125,
      "version": 1658,
      "versionNonce": 342535461,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 1 CPU core = 1000 millicores\n- 1 millicore = 0.001 CPU core",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 1 CPU core = 1000 millicores\n- 1 millicore = 0.001 CPU core",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y5MAYysn1f9xPXxCbjtlz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3458.044243893519,
      "y": 349.3398740411865,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0sV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 921059691,
      "version": 2017,
      "versionNonce": 2135146629,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406725826,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 500m means out every 100ms of clock cycle,\nthat container is going to get 50ms (50%)",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 500m means out every 100ms of clock cycle, that container is going to get 50ms (50%)",
