      "text": "- if we ask for 1000m, then we are essentially\nasking for 100ms out of total 200ms, and we\nmight be given any of the 2 cores and the\n100ms given could be distributed across those\ncores in any proportion",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we ask for 1000m, then we are essentially asking for 100ms out of total 200ms, and we might be given any of the 2 cores and the 100ms given could be distributed across those cores in any proportion",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AXAwZf0IHt-XVJFn1DsG7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2277.8756135903022,
      "y": 380.7655186789375,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 451649253,
      "version": 2452,
      "versionNonce": 307097067,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406741524,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if we ask for 1500m, then we want 150ms i.e.\nwe want 1 and a half, i.e. we might get full\n100ms on one core and 50ms on other core",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we ask for 1500m, then we want 150ms i.e. we want 1 and a half, i.e. we might get full 100ms on one core and 50ms on other core",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TAqWwf4dgfRQpV2i3Sa3f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2283.226691927678,
      "y": 566.4583065471829,
      "width": 953.2992863738174,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1821511723,
      "version": 2670,
      "versionNonce": 1544916677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768406885745,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- in most systems, we can start with 250m\ncpu quota i.e. 25%, that is a lot of time to\ndo work",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- in most systems, we can start with 250m cpu quota i.e. 25%, that is a lot of time to do work",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J26GM_Sqm1ctIh8MHv3VU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4491.142793837456,
      "y": 2527.2070892695315,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 338846437,
      "version": 841,
      "versionNonce": 1220897259,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768411411110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- it becomes super important to match number\nof threads (go-routines) with number of cores",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- it becomes super important to match number of threads (go-routines) with number of cores",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "d4tusRCMAVLgaF2_HhmT3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4486.610244919493,
      "y": 2198.461959647411,
      "width": 1606.5884552321018,
      "height": 254.50697372911762,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1224098635,
      "version": 2340,
      "versionNonce": 959983371,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768407002515,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Matching number of threads\nwith number of cores in Go",
      "fontSize": 101.80278949164705,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Matching number of threads with number of cores in Go",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hksHHxEMi_B2v4leye8YH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4494.6589363900675,
      "y": 2643.2977134089083,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 51.89501032713576,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 366892235,
      "version": 939,
      "versionNonce": 63609451,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768407081384,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- else, we are going to get trouble",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- else, we are going to get trouble",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qqbziLJtXNxguJe9th4Ub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4494.192146746244,
      "y": 2713.65949068037,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 207.58004130854303,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1715609899,
      "version": 1164,
      "versionNonce": 793516805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768410805807,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if we have more threads than cores, we have\nmore context switches, thus loosing lot of\ninstructions that could possibly be executed\nduring those context switches",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we have more threads than cores, we have more context switches, thus loosing lot of instructions that could possibly be executed during those context switches",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RYT7RF1r86a2b1r8OXB04",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4507.864890978108,
      "y": 2936.4329434099823,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1224565861,
      "version": 1324,
      "versionNonce": 1531265131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768410884711,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- thus, it is super important to match\nGOMAXPROCS with the number of cores we are\nusing",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- thus, it is super important to match GOMAXPROCS with the number of cores we are using",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YxIh9xLI9VUsudzqHMwar",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4511.015820375492,
      "y": 3113.609855085477,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 103.79002065427152,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1495993413,
      "version": 1484,
      "versionNonce": 1812891275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768410997364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if we use anything <= 1000m, we should always\nrun our Go program as a single thread",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we use anything <= 1000m, we should always run our Go program as a single thread",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6TFb5Zwv58aJCdI3dnvf0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4509.097783281739,
      "y": 3235.5490172809696,
      "width": 993.9063889134094,
      "height": 155.68503098140727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1016151531,
      "version": 1642,
      "versionNonce": 1226445637,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768411058215,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if we use anything <= 2000m, we can run as a\n2 threaded go program, since we can use\npotentially two cores at the same time",
      "fontSize": 41.516008261708606,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we use anything <= 2000m, we can run as a 2 threaded go program, since we can use potentially two cores at the same time",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xSLrE9_ExcyjSajEB1zCM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2596.061692533386,
      "y": 2248.2670319196295,
      "width": 1277.165944743068,
      "height": 287.03945360322194,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1014544971,
      "version": 1459,
      "versionNonce": 636723051,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768412745386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- If each service is running as a single threaded program, and we\nhad CPU affinity (which we don't), we could simplify our\nvisualization of 4 service running on a 2 CPU node sharing time like\nthis. With this configuration, we are leveraging CPUs with maximum\nefficiency. Context switches only take place when it's deemed\nnecessary",
      "fontSize": 38.27192714709624,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- If each service is running as a single threaded program, and we had CPU affinity (which we don't), we could simplify our visualization of 4 service running on a 2 CPU node sharing time like this. With this configuration, we are leveraging CPUs with maximum efficiency. Context switches only take place when it's deemed necessary",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
