      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768412265171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "service 5",
      "fontSize": 24.457171117758705,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "service 5",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yDz2vhnWrE6faK2XwbIVY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2633.7876057841154,
      "y": 2940.0551592047545,
      "width": 1072.2651101602899,
      "height": 80.3295224621015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1578660971,
      "version": 1707,
      "versionNonce": 691609541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768412265171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In reality however, there's no CPU affinity and threads are subject\nto 10ms time slices.",
      "fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In reality however, there's no CPU affinity and threads are subject to 10ms time slices.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KRdWeEL__clQbFLnpziym",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2635.3421936800582,
      "y": 3041.0074415702275,
      "width": 1072.2651101602899,
      "height": 160.659044924203,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1250100203,
      "version": 1907,
      "versionNonce": 1659559717,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768412265171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This means the full configured time for every cycle\n    - could be spent on any CPU \nand when or which CPU that happens on \n    - will change on every cycle",
      "fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This means the full configured time for every cycle\n    - could be spent on any CPU \nand when or which CPU that happens on \n    - will change on every cycle",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UL1oTarF1a3wdcaRsw7Va",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2625.5790660411712,
      "y": 3227.4378353245847,
      "width": 1072.2651101602899,
      "height": 80.3295224621015,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 407118789,
      "version": 2083,
      "versionNonce": 854438533,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768412265171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The key here is that k8s will allow service-1 to always have 125ms\nof time on a CPU when it's needed, on every cycle",
      "fontSize": 32.131808984840596,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The key here is that k8s will allow service-1 to always have 125ms of time on a CPU when it's needed, on every cycle",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "up8uSS3vZ3f6w5zEetZY7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5606.950579539016,
      "y": 1627.9106299052714,
      "width": 430.96163142650175,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b20",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 606998277,
      "version": 514,
      "versionNonce": 1958058531,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768416439465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- at the end of the day, the Go program is\na CPU bound program",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- at the end of the day, the Go program is a CPU bound program",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W0SoWSmv6m6ox0flbpRHT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5608.291490798209,
      "y": 1691.386700269487,
      "width": 430.96163142650175,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b21",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 104712613,
      "version": 868,
      "versionNonce": 1004821955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768416439465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- if we will be needing 25% or less than a\nfull core % of CPU, then our go program\nshould be running as a single threaded go\nprogram\n- because it is only ever using a single CPU\nin a clock cycle, and we don't want to have\nmore threads than number of cores",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- if we will be needing 25% or less than a full core % of CPU, then our go program should be running as a single threaded go program\n- because it is only ever using a single CPU in a clock cycle, and we don't want to have more threads than number of cores",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "J-lUZCvW8aCOHpRH3oodD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -6672.836995479796,
      "y": 832.6517437183177,
      "width": 737.5300579790203,
      "height": 142.49498412274187,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b22",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 726466091,
      "version": 2241,
      "versionNonce": 483336805,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768414238218,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Go Scheduler",
      "fontSize": 113.99598729819348,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Go Scheduler",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GO_-eaPzIT6BMdVjEJGCh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -5606.412055715597,
      "y": 1879.8293421175383,
      "width": 448.7679359829522,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b23",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 93909411,
      "version": 1006,
      "versionNonce": 599371107,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768416439465,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- use decent no.of cores, but not too much,\nfor a CPU Bound go program, and a core or\nless for a IO Bound go program",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- use decent no.of cores, but not too much, for a CPU Bound go program, and a core or less for a IO Bound go program",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
